0..66 Comment "// What divergence as a row entry refuses: a loop at a row without"
67..134 Comment "// `Partial`, a call of a diverging function from one, a handler of"
135..155 Comment "// `Partial`, and an"
156..232 Comment "// unread call of a diverging function dropped. Each would let a computation"
233..311 Comment "// that never returns stand where one that returns is expected. What checks is"
312..357 Comment "// in `../../model/control/divergence.gandr`."
358..360 Comment "//"
361..426 Comment "// - see: #1481 — `spinPure`, `spinFirst`, `tamed`, `unreadDiv`"
